                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A full priced demo. \nYou simply \"move\" the entire level, using your hands. \nSure, there\\'s a bit of novelty, with the candy theme, but seriously...\nEven the difficulty is a self-enforced one. \"Please, only use the red grips if you want a challenge\". \nSure thing, I get that. But isn't that more of a achivement, and not so much of a difficulty implementation?\n\n1 level.\nIt took me ~2 minutes to complete. That was the entire game.\nThink of this as level 1 of Super Mario. With only 1 type of enemy. For 20€.",
